cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these samples, ratios or estimator weights, please cite them as below."
title: "Tokenizer ratios: characters and words per token on OpenAI's o200k_base"
abstract: "951 text samples (English prose, technical docs, Python source, CSV, JSON, random IDs, emoji, Chinese, Japanese, Korean and Russian) counted with OpenAI's o200k_base tokenizer, with characters and words per token by content type and fitted weights for estimating token counts without a tokenizer."
